    "why": "decisions/0159 §5 (step 1). The staging bar becomes the site manager, at the top of every page in the admin command bar's look: Releases ▾ (on staging now, waiting, live and at which step), Upload (a zip goes straight onto staging and its checks run, through the one uploader), Changes, Note, and Publish ▾ (Publish now, Schedule, the next step; Turn off and Roll back once it's live). Opening a release on staging is the look and Publish is the sign-off: the separate Sign it off goes, here and on the Releases page. An upload on the Releases page also goes straight onto staging, with no Approve the plan or Put it on staging.",
